WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:11.383
Welcome to Y.D.R.B.N. On first launch, the Operator's Guide features a link to this walkthrough video, a Top Bar Faceplate Key, and a shortcut to safe cache tools.

2
00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:20.783
Switch to the Data Sheet tab for offline engine specs, darkroom notes, and credits, then click Understood to enter the main stereo deck.

3
00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:32.649
Reopening the guide upgrades the Faceplate Key into live shortcuts. Tap Install in the key or top bar anytime to mount Y.D.R.B.N. for standalone offline use.

4
00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:43.349
In the top-left corner, open your 14-slot Vinyl Crate Archive to search pressings, filter protected Favorites, or start hands-free Auto-Spin College Radio.

5
00:00:43.649 --> 00:00:54.816
Across the top bar, tap Today, tap the Heart icon to protect a favorite record, or open Share to export JPEGs and copy a one-tap Pressing DNA clone link.

6
00:00:55.116 --> 00:01:07.949
Open the Apparel Terminal for pixel-identical 300 DPI chest cutouts or plaques, three tour circuits, a custom one-off tour stop, zoomable back preview, and two-step PNG saves.

7
00:01:08.249 --> 00:01:17.382
Swipe left or right on the sleeve or tap the carousel arrows to browse your crate, and press Daily Drop to mint today's procedural album.

8
00:01:17.682 --> 00:01:26.949
Tap Zoom in the bottom-right corner of the sleeve to inspect front cover artwork and back liner notes at up to 250 percent magnification.

9
00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:37.625
Flip the sleeve for the concise eight-song tracklist, runout etching, and condition grade, or tap Read on the review box to open the full Archival Liner Notes pop-up.

10
00:01:37.925 --> 00:01:49.991
Click Spin Audio Clip to hear layered vintage instrument and vocal stems, cycle 33, 45, and 16 RPM speeds, or tap individual tracks on the back cover.

11
00:01:50.291 --> 00:02:04.158
Use the footer globe icon to switch between 15 languages, or open System Settings for four hardware color modes, online update checks, and a safe cache refresh.

12
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:14.291
Open The Cargo Bay to install and toggle expansion packs, or click New Crate to launch The Crate Forge and build custom word lists and cutout stamps.

13
00:02:14.591 --> 00:02:24.624
Use The Director's Chair to toggle built-in generator pools on or off, or open Archival Dispatch to submit anonymous word ideas and bug reports.

14
00:02:24.924 --> 00:02:38.057
Finally, open Customize A Drop to cycle darkroom filters on a staged photo, carry that photo straight into New Drop, and harvest novel words into rotation.
